        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Add on-screen text alert option for quota warnings",
        "body": "Fixes #1691\n\n## Summary\n\n- Add a General preference beside quota-warning sound to show the same warning copy as a centered on-screen card.\n- Keep the option off by default; notification behavior is unchanged unless the user opts in.\n- Keep the panel click-through, nonactivating, above normal windows, multi-space compatible, auto-dismissing, and Reduce Motion aware.\n- Expose the warning title and detail through accessibility label/value.\n- Prevent a canceled older dismissal task from closing a replacement alert by gating presentation generations.\n- Localize the setting across all shipped catalogs and thank @SAASEmpiree in the changelog.\n\n## Maintainer decision\n\nRecommendation: merge. This is a bounded opt-in that exactly matches the issue request and reuses existing threshold/redaction copy. The tradeoff is a visually prominent warning card; default-off behavior, click-through presentation, and no focus activation keep it non-disruptive.\n\n## Proof\n\n- `make check`\n- `swift test --filter QuotaWarningAlertPresentationStateTests`\n- `swift test --filter SettingsStoreTests`\n- `swift test --filter UsageStoreSessionQuotaTransitionTests`\n- `swift test --filter CommandCodeQuotaTransitionTests`\n- `make test` (44/44 shards passed; one unrelated shard passed its automatic retry)\n- branch-scoped autoreview (clean)\n- exact-head ad-hoc package at `6ac5f34f5880713424eb81b98b89297bad6c840f`\n- live Tart/Peekaboo proof: settings placement, centered geometry/copy, click-through/nonfocus behavior, accessibility path, and auto-dismiss\n- fresh final-head host capture before another concurrent CodexBar worker replaced the running bundle; final-head-only delta from the Tart runtime proof is changelog/localization catalogs\n\n## Contributor media\n\nSettings:\n\n![Quota warning settings showing the new Show on-screen text alert checkbox](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SAASEmpiree/CodexBar/pr1692-media/.github/pr-media/onscreen-alert-settings.png)\n\nCentered alert:\n\n![Centered on-screen quota warning card](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SAASEmpiree/CodexBar/pr1692-media/.github/pr-media/onscreen-alert-card.png)\n\nThe contributor captured the card through a local-only preview trigger; that preview control is not included in this PR.",
